config PCIE_EP_ROCKCHIP_RK3568
	bool "Rockchip RK3568 PCIe endpoint controller"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ROCKCHIP_RK3568_PCIE_EP_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the endpoint driver for the dual-mode PCIe 3.0 x2
	  controller in the Rockchip RK3568.

	  The clocks, reset and PCIe PHY must be initialized before this
	  driver runs. The driver configures the controller for endpoint
	  mode, starts link training, manages outbound iATU windows and
	  generates legacy, MSI and MSI-X interrupts.
